# Keep the upload — and the api/pulse.py bundle, which globs the whole Pulse app — free of
# local artifacts and anything a serverless function never runs. `vercel` from the CLI does
# not read .gitignore, so virtualenvs must be named here explicitly or they are uploaded.
.venv/
venv/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/

node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Test suites and their fixtures
**/tests/
owls-street-view/test_logs.py

# Local runtime state. Pulse's alert database lives on a persistent volume in the container
# deployment and in /tmp here; a committed copy would only mislead.
**/data/
**/logs/
owls-street-pulse/config/config.yaml.example

# Container and CI scaffolding
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
**/docker-compose.yml
docker-entrypoint.sh
**/docker-entrypoint.sh
render.yaml
.github/

# Documentation
*.md
**/*.md
ai_specs/
**/ai_specs/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
